    🌸🐇📬 json❗️                  200 application/json  Results.Json
    🐣🐇📬 json❗️                  201 Created           Results.Created
    🕳🐇📬❗️                       204 No Content        Results.NoContent
    🚫🐇📬 message❗️               400, a problem        Results.BadRequest
    👻🐇📬 message❗️               404, a problem        Results.NotFound
    💥🐇📬 message❗️               500, a problem        Results.Problem
    📛🐇📬 code message❗️          any status, a problem Results.Problem
    📦🐇📬 data contentType❗️      200 with a byte body  Results.Bytes
